{
  "file": "module5",
  "page": 43,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.21469116210938,
        527.2782592773438,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "Evidence:  In preparation for the GDG meeting on the management of TB in children and adolescents,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.974620819091797,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.3838500976562,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "an update of the review on the diagnostic accuracy of Xpert MTB/RIF and Xpert Ultra for TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        90.99671936035156,
        527.3693237304688,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "(18) in children   was performed. A systematic search of the literature was carried out in January 2021.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.6171875,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "This update focused specifically on the diagnostic accuracy of Xpert Ultra in gastric aspirate or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.3849487304688,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "lavage specimens and stool specimens for the diagnosis of PTB and rifampicin resistance in children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.4410400390625,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "below 10 years of age. Nine studies that evaluated the diagnostic accuracy of Xpert Ultra in gastric",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.4386596679688,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "aspirate and/or stool specimens in children were identified. For the meta-analysis, six studies (653",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        156.99671936035156,
        527.4083251953125,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "(19–24) participants) provided data for gastric specimens   and six studies (1278 participants) for stool",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.1967315673828,
        527.4042358398438,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "(20, 23–27) specimens  . The review found that for gastric aspirate, Xpert Ultra sensitivity was 64% in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        527.4136962890625,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "children 0–9 years, against a microbiological reference standard and specificity was 95%. For stool,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3907012939453,
        527.4146728515625,
        213.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "Xpert Ultra sensitivity was 53% in children 0–9 years, against the microbiological reference standard",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.59071350097656,
        527.4331665039062,
        227.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "and specificity was 98%. Sensitivity estimates against a composite reference standard were lower for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.7906036376953,
        527.43994140625,
        240.2335968017578
      ],
      "text": "both specimen types. There were no studies that evaluated the diagnostic accuracy of Xpert Ultra",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        238.99061584472656,
        430.98089599609375,
        253.43360900878906
      ],
      "text": "for detection of rifampicin resistance using gastric aspirate or stool specimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.694580078125,
        527.57421875,
        275.1376037597656
      ],
      "text": "Of the nine studies, eight (89%) reported the proportion of Xpert Ultra positive results that were trace",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985340118408203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89453125,
        527.3882446289062,
        288.3375549316406
      ],
      "text": "results. In these eight studies, of the total Xpert Ultra positive results, the proportion (expressed as a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.094482421875,
        527.3915405273438,
        301.5375061035156
      ],
      "text": "percentage) of Ultra trace results ranged from 0% to 66% (median 52%) in studies evaluating gastric",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.29449462890625,
        457.5986022949219,
        314.7375183105469
      ],
      "text": "specimens and from 0% to 84% (median 52%) in studies evaluating stool specimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.822509765625,
        527.4020385742188,
        336.4415283203125
      ],
      "text": "GDG considerations : The GDG members discussed that all TB tests, including the microbiological",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1985168457031,
        527.3882446289062,
        349.64154052734375
      ],
      "text": "reference standard (usually culture or Xpert Ultra on respiratory samples) have suboptimal sensitivity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39849853515625,
        527.43994140625,
        362.8415222167969
      ],
      "text": "in children, due to the paucibacillary nature of TB disease in this age group. Therefore, the panel",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5985107421875,
        527.5707397460938,
        376.0415344238281
      ],
      "text": "highlighted that a positive test accurately determines a case of TB disease, but a negative test does not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963438987731934,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7984924316406,
        527.4201049804688,
        389.24151611328125
      ],
      "text": "exclude TB disease. As no studies assessed the diagnostic accuracy for Xpert Ultra for the detection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.9985046386719,
        527.4068603515625,
        402.4415283203125
      ],
      "text": "of rifampicin resistance in children, conclusions related to the use of Xpert Ultra for the diagnosis of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1985168457031,
        527.6111450195312,
        415.64154052734375
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin resistance were based on data in adults, evaluated for the 2020 rapid diagnostic guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.978128433227539,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39849853515625,
        527.3914794921875,
        428.8415222167969
      ],
      "text": "The GDG members agreed that the desirable effects from the test in both specimens are moderate,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.5985107421875,
        527.411376953125,
        442.0415344238281
      ],
      "text": "but large for the detection of rifampicin resistance, because of the large impact on the choice of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.7984924316406,
        527.5213623046875,
        455.24151611328125
      ],
      "text": "effective treatment when rifampicin resistance is detected. The panel noted that false-negative results",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.984389305114746,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.9985046386719,
        527.3936767578125,
        468.4415283203125
      ],
      "text": "should be interpreted within the context of the clinical picture, and clinicians should not solely use a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.1985168457031,
        527.537353515625,
        481.64154052734375
      ],
      "text": "negative test to rule out disease. The GDG judged that the balance of effects favours the intervention",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990245819091797,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.39849853515625,
        527.4201049804688,
        494.8415222167969
      ],
      "text": "(considering both the moderate desirable effects and small undesirable effects), based on moderate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.5985107421875,
        354.7178955078125,
        508.0415344238281
      ],
      "text": "certainty evidence for both gastric aspirate and stool samples.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.3023681640625,
        527.4244995117188,
        529.745361328125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG judged that more time and training-related resources would be required to collect gastric",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.50244140625,
        527.4935913085938,
        542.9454345703125
      ],
      "text": "aspirate specimens, and that the procedure would also often require hospital admission. Stool",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.702392578125,
        527.4234008789062,
        556.1453857421875
      ],
      "text": "processing may result in some additional time requirement to prepare the sample, depending on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.9024047851562,
        527.2490844726562,
        569.3453979492188
      ],
      "text": "the processing method. The panel decided upon comparing the cost of doing the tests on the sample",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.974620819091797,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1024169921875,
        524.3975219726562,
        582.54541015625
      ],
      "text": "types versus not doing the test. The panel then concluded that the costs for both specimen types vary.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968605041503906,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        589.806396484375,
        527.3923950195312,
        604.2493896484375
      ],
      "text": "While there were no studies on the cost-effectiveness of gastric aspirate, a cost-effectiveness study",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        603.0062866210938,
        527.3958740234375,
        617.4492797851562
      ],
      "text": "compared stool testing against clinical diagnosis at PHCs in Uganda, assuming that no respiratory",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.2064208984375,
        504.61383056640625,
        630.6494140625
      ],
      "text": "samples would be collected without referral to the hospital or without invasive sampling (see",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        505.2507019042969,
        616.2064208984375,
        527.4266357421875,
        630.6494140625
      ],
      "text": "web",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.4063720703125,
        106.96810150146484,
        643.849365234375
      ],
      "text": "annex 4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.9677963256836,
        629.4063720703125,
        527.4526977539062,
        643.849365234375
      ],
      "text": "). Compared to that standard of care, stool testing was more effective, but also more costly.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.6063842773438,
        527.5284423828125,
        657.0493774414062
      ],
      "text": "The GDG members discussed that an Xpert Ultra test on stool samples becomes cost-effective even at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970108985900879,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.806396484375,
        527.4015502929688,
        670.2493896484375
      ],
      "text": "a TB prevalence level of 3% at a zero discount rate (the practice of discounting future health effects).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.0062866210938,
        527.4312133789062,
        683.4492797851562
      ],
      "text": "Implementation aspects such as the importance of obtaining microbiological confirmation and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.2064208984375,
        527.4267578125,
        696.6494140625
      ],
      "text": "detection of rifampicin resistance would further favour cost-effectiveness of stool testing. The panel",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.4063720703125,
        495.6338806152344,
        709.849365234375
      ],
      "text": "therefore concluded that the evidence probably favours Xpert Ultra testing on stool samples.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.1102905273438,
        527.4221801757812,
        731.5532836914062
      ],
      "text": "In terms of acceptability, although the gastric aspirate sample collection was found to be an invasive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        730.310302734375,
        527.3958129882812,
        744.7532958984375
      ],
      "text": "procedure (that could be uncomfortable to children), the panel felt that the procedure is probably",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        743.5103149414062,
        527.1072387695312,
        757.9533081054688
      ],
      "text": "acceptable to children, caregivers and health care workers (HCW), considering the role of this procedure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        756.7103271484375,
        527.403564453125,
        771.1533203125
      ],
      "text": "to obtain bacteriological confirmation at higher level facilities. The GDG noted the importance of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        325.393798828125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "4. Diagnostic approaches for TB in children and adolescents 19",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}